MODULE: CoreStepRefinedAppendWithoutHead
TARGET: CoreStepRefined
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the witness append records an append without moving the head
PERTURBS: WalAppend

--- FIND
    /\ ~appended /\ ~deleted /\ head' = head + 1 /\ appended' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the append flag moves but the WAL head does not.
    /\ ~appended /\ ~deleted /\ head' = head /\ appended' = TRUE
--- END
